# Files a shell or the Docker daemon parses directly always check out with LF, regardless of the
# platform's line-ending settings. CRLF in a Dockerfile can break multi-line RUN continuations on
# some Docker builder versions, and CRLF in a shell script breaks it outright.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
